# Sprite Sheet Conventions (Project Recipe)

## Character sheet contract

For directional movement sheets:

- Grid: `4x4`
- Frame size: project-defined fixed cell
- Rows:
  - Row 0 -> down
  - Row 1 -> up
  - Row 2 -> right
  - Row 3 -> left

## Animation naming contract

- `walk-down` -> frames `0..3`
- `walk-up` -> frames `4..7`
- `walk-right` -> frames `8..11`
- `walk-left` -> frames `12..15`
- idles at first frame of each row

## Quality checks

- No mixed directions within row
- Consistent silhouette and anchor point
- Idle/walk transitions loop cleanly
